```text
products/   → ship product code
services/   → shared platform services
hosts/      → infrastructure as code
lab/        → experiments (never ship as-is)
docs/       → durable knowledge
workspace/  → disposable scratch
agents/     → role profiles / neo packs
scripts/    → automation
