## neo-harness

If embedded (`scripts/neo` present):

```bash
cp env.neo.example .env   # set Neo4j
./scripts/neo init-db
./scripts/neo start --task-file jobs/smoke-mock.md --agent workspace -p mock
```

See [neo-harness starting-a-workspace](https://github.com/westailabs/neo-harness/blob/master/docs/starting-a-workspace.md).

